{"title":"【光线追踪】使用OpenMP并行加速程序渲染","uid":"b6e2fc9826dfe90e907931383b1afc4a","slug":"【光线追踪】使用OpenMP并行加速程序渲染","date":"2026-06-09T09:40:59.000Z","updated":"2026-06-09T10:16:23.205Z","comments":true,"path":"api/articles/【光线追踪】使用OpenMP并行加速程序渲染.json","keywords":null,"cover":[],"content":"<div id=\"content-inner\" class=\"layout\" role=\"main\">\n\n<div id=\"post\">\n\n<p><strong>前言</strong>：<br>此文章是第一篇关于光线追踪中细节的工具文章，不会涉及太多原理，更多的是在实际项目中的一个可参考方案及我所踩过的坑的记录（<del>拿出来给大家开心一下</del>）</p>\n<ul>\n<li>平台：Windows</li>\n<li>工具：cmake</li>\n</ul>\n<h1 id=\"\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"&lt;a href&#x3D;”#如何在cmake中开启OpenMP” class&#x3D;”headerlink”\"></a>&lt;a href&#x3D;”#如何在cmake中开启OpenMP” class&#x3D;”headerlink”</h1><p>title&#x3D;”如何在cmake中开启OpenMP”&gt;</a>如何在cmake中开启OpenMP</p>\n<p>先看<code>CMakeLists.txt</code>中需要<strong>增加</strong>什么代码</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight c++\">\n<table>\n<colgroup>\n<col style=\"width: 100%\" />\n</colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"code\"><pre><code># omp 并行\nfind_package(OpenMP REQUIRED)\n\n<h1 id=\"设置项目最终需要链接的list\"><a href=\"#设置项目最终需要链接的list\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"设置项目最终需要链接的list\"></a>设置项目最终需要链接的list</h1><p>set(PROJ_INCLUDE_DIRS)<br>set(PROJ_LIBS)<br>set(PROJ_COMPILE_OPTIONS)</p>\n<p>list(APPEND PROJ_LIBS ${OpenMP_CXX_LIBRARIES})<br>list(APPEND PROJ_INCLUDE_DIRS ${OpenMP_CXX_INCLUDE_DIRS})<br>list(APPEND PROJ_COMPILE_OPTIONS ${OpenMP_CXX_FLAGS})</p>\n<h1 id=\"进行链接\"><a href=\"#进行链接\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"进行链接\"></a>进行链接</h1><p>add_executable(test main.cpp)</p>\n<p>target_include_directories(test PRIVATE ${PROJ_INCLUDE_DIRS})<br>target_compile_options(test PRIVATE ${PROJ_COMPILE_OPTIONS})<br>target_link_libraries(test PRIVATE ${PROJ_LIBS})</code></pre></td></p>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</figure>\n\n<p>有了编译条件，我们来看一下在程序中如何使用</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight c++\">\n<table>\n<colgroup>\n<col style=\"width: 100%\" />\n</colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"code\"><pre><code>#include &lt;iostream&gt;\n#include &quot;omp.h&quot;\n\n<p>int main()<br>{<br>    #pragma omp parallel<br>    std::cout &lt;&lt; &quot;hello world&quot; &lt;&lt; std::endl;<br>    return 0;<br>}</code></pre></td></p>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</figure>\n\n<ol>\n<li>在头文件中include <code>omp.h</code></li>\n<li>在需要并行运行的代码块前添加语句<code>#pragma omp parallel</code></li>\n</ol>\n<p>我们将代码编译并运行后的结果：<br><img src=\"/pic%5C2023_6_13_1.jpg\"><br>可见，一行代码被运行了16次，omp并行在正常运行，接下来使用到光追中吧</p>\n<h1 id=\"-1\"><a href=\"#-1\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"&lt;a href&#x3D;”#在光追中使用omp” class&#x3D;”headerlink”\"></a>&lt;a href&#x3D;”#在光追中使用omp” class&#x3D;”headerlink”</h1><p>title&#x3D;”在光追中使用omp”&gt;</a>在光追中使用omp</p>\n<p>光线追踪算法中，从相机出发，逐像素发射一系列光线，跟踪每一条光线得到像素点的值，遍历像素一般是用两个嵌套的for循环来做，这个过程显然可以进行并行计算。</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight c++\">\n<table>\n<colgroup>\n<col style=\"width: 100%\" />\n</colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"code\"><pre><code>for(int i = 0; i &lt; Height; ++i)\n{\n    for(int j = 0; j &lt; Width; ++j){\n        // Generate Rays\n\n<div class=\"language-txt\"><button title=\"Copy code\" class=\"copy\"></button><span class=\"lang\">txt</span><pre class=\"shiki material-theme-palenight\" style=\"background-color: #1a1a1a\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #babed8\">    // for ray in Rays:   trace(ray) ...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #babed8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>}</code></pre></td></p>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</figure>\n\n<p>然而，根据上文的情况看来，使用<code>#pragma omp parallel</code>，会让这个嵌套for循环执行10次，并不会加速算法<br>正确方法是在语句后加上<code>for</code>，即可以对（嵌套）for循环的代码块进行并行运算。</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight c++\">\n<table>\n<colgroup>\n<col style=\"width: 100%\" />\n</colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"code\"><pre><code>#pragma omp parallel for\nfor(int i = 0; i &lt; Height; ++i)\n{\n    for(int j = 0; j &lt; Width; ++j){\n        // Generate Rays\n\n<div class=\"language-txt\"><button title=\"Copy code\" class=\"copy\"></button><span class=\"lang\">txt</span><pre class=\"shiki material-theme-palenight\" style=\"background-color: #1a1a1a\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #babed8\">    // for ray in Rays:   trace(ray) ...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #babed8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>}</code></pre></td></p>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</figure>\n\n<p><strong>注意：for循环中的代码片段应是独立得到结果，互不干扰才能正常运行</strong></p>\n<h1 id=\"错误示例\"><a href=\"#错误示例\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"错误示例\"></a><a href=\"#错误示例\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"错误示例\"></a>错误示例</h1><p>我在做GAMES101的作业7时，在实现并行运算的过程中得到了这样的结果：<br><img src=\"/pic%5C2023_6_16_1.png\"><br>原因是GAMES提供的框架中，在得到光线结果后，对framebuffer的取值用的是m，且每次循环结束时m++，这就导致不同进程相互干扰，得到错误的结果</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight c++\">\n<table>\n<colgroup>\n<col style=\"width: 100%\" />\n</colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"code\"><pre><code>for(int i = 0; i &lt; Height; ++i)\n{\n    for(int j = 0; j &lt; Width; ++j){\n        // Generate Rays\n\n<div class=\"language-txt\"><button title=\"Copy code\" class=\"copy\"></button><span class=\"lang\">txt</span><pre class=\"shiki material-theme-palenight\" style=\"background-color: #1a1a1a\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #babed8\">    // for ray in Rays:   trace(ray) ...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #babed8\">    framebuffer[m] = trace(ray);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #babed8\">    m++;  //错误示范</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #babed8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>}</code></pre></td></p>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"post-copyright\">\n\n<div class=\"post-copyright__author\">\n\n<p><span class=\"post-copyright-meta\">文章作者:<br></span><span class=\"post-copyright-info\"><a href=\"http://example.com/\">Neo</a></span></p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"post-copyright__type\">\n\n<p><span class=\"post-copyright-meta\">文章链接:<br></span><span class=\"post-copyright-info\"><a href=\"http://example.com/2023/06/13/%E3%80%90%E5%85%89%E7%BA%BF%E8%BF%BD%E8%B8%AA%E3%80%91%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8OpenMP%E5%B9%B6%E8%A1%8C%E5%8A%A0%E9%80%9F%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E6%B8%B2%E6%9F%93/\">http://example.com/2023/06/13/【光线追踪】使用OpenMP并行加速程序渲染/</a></span></p>\n</div>","feature":true,"text":" 前言：此文章是第一篇关于光线追踪中细节的工具文章，不会涉及太多原理，更多的是在实际项目中的一个可参考方案及我所踩过的坑的记录（拿出来给大家开心一下） 平台：W...","permalink":"/post/【光线追踪】使用OpenMP并行加速程序渲染","photos":[],"count_time":{"symbolsCount":"2.1k","symbolsTime":"2 mins."},"categories":[],"tags":[{"name":"光追","slug":"光追","count":2,"path":"api/tags/光追.json"},{"name":"渲染","slug":"渲染","count":3,"path":"api/tags/渲染.json"}],"toc":"<ol class=\"toc\"><li class=\"toc-item toc-level-1\"><a class=\"toc-link\" href=\"#post\"><span class=\"toc-text\">&lt;a href&#x3D;”#如何在cmake中开启OpenMP” class&#x3D;”headerlink”</span></a></li><li class=\"toc-item toc-level-1\"><a class=\"toc-link\" href=\"#%E8%AE%BE%E7%BD%AE%E9%A1%B9%E7%9B%AE%E6%9C%80%E7%BB%88%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E9%93%BE%E6%8E%A5%E7%9A%84list\"><span class=\"toc-text\">设置项目最终需要链接的list</span></a></li><li class=\"toc-item toc-level-1\"><a class=\"toc-link\" href=\"#%E8%BF%9B%E8%A1%8C%E9%93%BE%E6%8E%A5\"><span class=\"toc-text\">进行链接</span></a></li><li class=\"toc-item toc-level-1\"><a class=\"toc-link\" href=\"#-1\"><span class=\"toc-text\">&lt;a href&#x3D;”#在光追中使用omp” class&#x3D;”headerlink”</span></a></li><li class=\"toc-item toc-level-1\"><a class=\"toc-link\" href=\"#%E9%94%99%E8%AF%AF%E7%A4%BA%E4%BE%8B\"><span class=\"toc-text\">错误示例</span></a></li></ol>","author":{"name":"Aurora","slug":"blog-author","avatar":"","link":"/","description":"","socials":{"github":"","twitter":"","stackoverflow":"","wechat":"","qq":"","weibo":"","zhihu":"","csdn":"","juejin":"","customs":{}}},"mapped":true,"hidden":false,"prev_post":{"title":"Unity-Shader入门精要笔记","uid":"07603d44ff9ca2ab9883bf09108e4d77","slug":"Unity-Shader入门精要笔记","date":"2026-06-09T09:41:13.000Z","updated":"2026-06-09T10:16:29.961Z","comments":true,"path":"api/articles/U